      },
      "body": {
        "text": "Altman acknowledged loss-of-control risk and says OpenAI has more to disclose about rogue AI agents, though none at the level of the Hugging Face hack. The Verge says he suggested disclosure will take a long time.",
        "facts": [
          "F6"
        ]
      },
      "quote_id": null,
      "quote_excerpt": null,
