    "text": "On Oct 6, 2026, French AI lab Mistral launched a public preview of Mistral Large 4 (\"Le Chonk\"), a 1-trillion-parameter model it pitches for cyber defense. Weights are due at the end of October. [CLAIM: Mistral says] it is the best open-weight model from the US or Europe, and an independent index puts it well behind the top closed models.",
